<title>USA: MMI Cos stake sold by American Hospital.</title>
<headline>MMI Cos stake sold by American Hospital.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Hospital Association Services Inc said Tuesday it sold 949,760 common shares of MMI Companies Inc, its entire stake in the company.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, American Hospital said it sold the stake on October 25 in an underwritten public offering. No price per share was given.</p>
